    rdf:value """Monday, Oct. 19, 1908
Grace’s.
Fine. 
8 a.m. Reached here pretty tired. Rested most of the day, after seeing Karin off, having bought her a  dress . Poor Mr. Cannon is quite ill and cannot leave the house. """^^xsd:string ;
